From: Snuffpig <181518943+Snuffpig@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/i915 & drm/amdgpu: Expose read-only CB1_OUTPUT_FORMAT and CB1_OUTPUT_BPC telemetry

Add immutable, read-only connector properties CB1_OUTPUT_FORMAT (enum:
Unknown, RGB 4:4:4, YCbCr 4:4:4, YCbCr 4:2:2, YCbCr 4:2:0) and
CB1_OUTPUT_BPC (range 0..16) on Intel i915 (DP/PCON and HDMI) and AMD
amdgpu_dm digital connectors.

Values are updated solely from committed hardware/CRTC/stream state on
enable, disable, and i915 initial hardware readout, with zero impact on
modeset selection or atomic validation.

